      "locator_status": "validated",
      "normalized_text": "Revenue increased 25% from USD 8,000,000 to USD 10,000,000, whereas inventory increased 60% from USD 1,500,000 to USD 2,400,000. Closing inventory divided by annual cost of sales multiplied by 365 is 114.0625 days in FY2024 and 136.875 days in FY2025; this is a closing-balance diagnostic, not average inventory turnover.",
